{"question_id": "SMK-01", "scenario": "parameter", "http_status": 200, "request_id": "c391f02c6b17436caa2322686fac5952", "trace_id": "7acdbc333648481bb7db795c4d9d4d64", "status_field": "success", "answer": "根据手册内容，SUMMIT 2196 系列泵长期存放时的要求如下：\n\n- 存放环境：应将泵存放在清洁、干燥的地方，并且不要取下管路接头盖。\n- 泵轴转动频率：至少每周用手旋转泵轴一次，以保持轴承上覆有保护油膜或油脂。\n\n如要长期存放，可向 Summit Pump, Inc. 购买专用护理产品。", "refusal": false, "citation_count": 3, "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 9, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5ce75c93c0a1-000-5ce75c93c0a1"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 12, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-847dedb676cd-000-847dedb676cd"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}], "shadow_audit": {"request_id": "c391f02c6b17436caa2322686fac5952", "question_id": null, "kb_id": "8fce4626859d44abb70a9ae5b0372cea", "generation": "g5162e7fb4208635103ff4ebb", "structural_valid": true, "invalid_chunk_count": 0, "invalid_page_count": 0, "invalid_document_count": 0, "duplicate_citation_count": 0, "emitted_citation_count": 3, "answer_without_citation": 0, "citation_traceability": 1, "cross_kb_reference": 0, "empty_citation_count": 0, "audit_status": "ok", "audit_mode": "shadow_non_blocking", "llm_called": false, "gold_used": false, "timestamp": "2026-08-02T20:58:00+0800"}, "safety_policy": "allowed", "error_code": null, "latency_seconds": 7.105, "fallback_detected": false, "stage": "smoke"}
{"question_id": "SMK-02", "scenario": "table", "http_status": 200, "request_id": "db5504315f41404fa620e361b84570af", "trace_id": "6f5241ac5f054bf893aa25f34a92b4f0", "status_field": "success", "answer": "根据SUMMIT泵手册，对润滑脂的适用温度、稠度和重新润滑周期的规定如下：\n\n- **适用温度**：适用于泵送物质温度为 -60°F 至 350°F 的情况。对于温度超过 350°F 的情况，不建议使用润滑脂。\n- **稠度**：应使用 NLGI 2 号稠度的润滑脂。\n- **重新润滑周期**：每三个月对轴承进行一次重新润滑。\n\n可使用的润滑脂示例包括雪铁戈（Chevron）Mystic EP2。", "refusal": false, "citation_count": 3, "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 16, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-e39749fc478f-000-e39749fc478f"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 14, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-8a9134f69b7a-000-8a9134f69b7a"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 15, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-38cc6dafdf6c-000-38cc6dafdf6c"}], "shadow_audit": {"request_id": "db5504315f41404fa620e361b84570af", "question_id": null, "kb_id": "8fce4626859d44abb70a9ae5b0372cea", "generation": "g5162e7fb4208635103ff4ebb", "structural_valid": true, "invalid_chunk_count": 0, "invalid_page_count": 0, "invalid_document_count": 0, "duplicate_citation_count": 0, "emitted_citation_count": 3, "answer_without_citation": 0, "citation_traceability": 1, "cross_kb_reference": 0, "empty_citation_count": 0, "audit_status": "ok", "audit_mode": "shadow_non_blocking", "llm_called": false, "gold_used": false, "timestamp": "2026-08-02T20:58:05+0800"}, "safety_policy": "allowed", "error_code": null, "latency_seconds": 4.336, "fallback_detected": false, "stage": "smoke"}
{"question_id": "SMK-03", "scenario": "procedure", "http_status": 200, "request_id": "8b509eb4170a47a69e18a8cfe36fa42b", "trace_id": "b583983f8cf447f280756245a5c6dfa8", "status_field": "success", "answer": "根据 SUMMIT PUMP 2196 / 2196-LF / 2196-R / 2796 型安装、操作及维护手册（文件：2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf，第17页），离心泵的标准启动步骤如下：\n\n1. 用手旋转泵，确保旋转部件能够自由转动。  \n2. 确保入口阀打开。  \n3. 将出口阀半关闭。  \n4. 解除对泵驱动器电源的锁定。  \n5. 启动电机，待电机达到工作速度后，慢慢打开出口阀。  \n6. 检查填料函的滴漏情况，必要时进行调整，使其达到每分钟滴漏 40–65 滴的速度。\n\n此外，在启动前还应：\n- 检查叶轮间隙（运输过程中设置可能发生变化）；\n- 对泵进行灌注，即在启动前向入口管路和泵体中充入液体，通过打开入口隔离阀和填料密封液阀开始灌注。", "refusal": false, "citation_count": 3, "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 49, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-70af961007ec-000-70af961007ec"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 53, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-c8188ff9d303-000-c8188ff9d303"}], "shadow_audit": {"request_id": "8b509eb4170a47a69e18a8cfe36fa42b", "question_id": null, "kb_id": "8fce4626859d44abb70a9ae5b0372cea", "generation": "g5162e7fb4208635103ff4ebb", "structural_valid": true, "invalid_chunk_count": 0, "invalid_page_count": 0, "invalid_document_count": 0, "duplicate_citation_count": 0, "emitted_citation_count": 3, "answer_without_citation": 0, "citation_traceability": 1, "cross_kb_reference": 0, "empty_citation_count": 0, "audit_status": "ok", "audit_mode": "shadow_non_blocking", "llm_called": false, "gold_used": false, "timestamp": "2026-08-02T20:58:11+0800"}, "safety_policy": "allowed", "error_code": null, "latency_seconds": 6.384, "fallback_detected": false, "stage": "smoke"}
{"question_id": "SMK-04", "scenario": "troubleshooting", "http_status": 200, "request_id": "b16831e4759b4ef2bb1a00e8639b5492", "trace_id": "dc21476e9b4e4618900b8d128791410e", "status_field": "success", "answer": "根据SUMMIT PUMP 2196 / 2196-LF / 2196-R / 2796型安装、操作及维护手册（文件2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf，页码23），泵不输送液体的常见原因及对应处理方法如下：\n\n**常见原因及处理方法：**\n\n- **泵没有灌注**  \n  → 重新灌注泵。\n\n- **旋转方向不正确**  \n  → 调换电机接线。\n\n- **叶轮卡塞**  \n  → 反向冲洗泵。\n\n- **入口管路堵塞**  \n  → 去除异物。", "refusal": false, "citation_count": 3, "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 11, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-114bea8f37bc-000-114bea8f37bc"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 24, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-f14509fdd142-000-f14509fdd142"}], "shadow_audit": {"request_id": "b16831e4759b4ef2bb1a00e8639b5492", "question_id": null, "kb_id": "8fce4626859d44abb70a9ae5b0372cea", "generation": "g5162e7fb4208635103ff4ebb", "structural_valid": true, "invalid_chunk_count": 0, "invalid_page_count": 0, "invalid_document_count": 0, "duplicate_citation_count": 0, "emitted_citation_count": 3, "answer_without_citation": 0, "citation_traceability": 1, "cross_kb_reference": 0, "empty_citation_count": 0, "audit_status": "ok", "audit_mode": "shadow_non_blocking", "llm_called": false, "gold_used": false, "timestamp": "2026-08-02T20:58:18+0800"}, "safety_policy": "allowed", "error_code": null, "latency_seconds": 7.109, "fallback_detected": false, "stage": "smoke"}
{"question_id": "SMK-05", "scenario": "safety", "http_status": 200, "request_id": "0d1167d2e1954d33b319dc050f976704", "trace_id": "781d8160de164279a5b7fa3c44d4b16f", "status_field": "success", "answer": "根据 SUMMIT 手册，在尝试对泵进行维修之前，必须完成以下安全步骤：\n\n1. 执行停机程序。  \n2. 切断电源。  \n3. 使泵冷却。  \n4. 关闭入口阀和出口阀。  \n5. 排空泵。\n\n来源：文件 2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf，第23页，安装、操作及维护手册。", "refusal": false, "citation_count": 3, "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 23, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-05fa62ad30d3-000-05fa62ad30d3"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 7, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-5d8e22b0294d-000-5d8e22b0294d"}], "shadow_audit": {"request_id": "0d1167d2e1954d33b319dc050f976704", "question_id": null, "kb_id": "8fce4626859d44abb70a9ae5b0372cea", "generation": "g5162e7fb4208635103ff4ebb", "structural_valid": true, "invalid_chunk_count": 0, "invalid_page_count": 0, "invalid_document_count": 0, "duplicate_citation_count": 0, "emitted_citation_count": 3, "answer_without_citation": 0, "citation_traceability": 1, "cross_kb_reference": 0, "empty_citation_count": 0, "audit_status": "ok", "audit_mode": "shadow_non_blocking", "llm_called": false, "gold_used": false, "timestamp": "2026-08-02T20:58:23+0800"}, "safety_policy": "allowed", "error_code": null, "latency_seconds": 5.013, "fallback_detected": false, "stage": "smoke"}
{"question_id": "SMK-06", "scenario": "cross_page", "http_status": 200, "request_id": "f17522407a1649a1ae1eed68867232d1", "trace_id": "f072db622bce494091af18251701ac67", "status_field": "success", "answer": "两份手册对离心泵干运行和启动前灌注的共同要求如下：\n\n1. **严禁干运行**：  \n   两份手册均明确指出，离心泵严禁在未注液（无液体）的情况下运行。干运行可能导致轴封损坏、高温、机械密封失效，甚至引发严重安全事故。\n\n2. **启动前必须灌注**：  \n   两份手册都强调，启动离心泵前必须确保泵体和吸入管路充满液体。只有在泵内充满液体的条件下，泵才能正常工作并保证轴封的冷却与润滑。\n\n3. **保护机械密封**：  \n   液体不仅用于泵的正常运行，还作为轴封（特别是机械密封）的冷却和润滑介质。因此，灌注不足或干运行会直接导致密封损坏。\n\n综上，两份手册共同要求：**启动前必须充分灌注，严禁任何形式的干运行，以防止设备损坏和安全事故发生**。", "refusal": false, "citation_count": 3, "citations": [{"citation_id": "cite_1", "document_name": "2196-ANSI-Manual-Chinese.pdf", "page": 17, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-护手册-d1faf220e6f2-000-d1faf220e6f2"}, {"citation_id": "cite_2", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 30, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-和关闭-2020c244c35a-000-2020c244c35a"}, {"citation_id": "cite_3", "document_name": "t1739cn.pdf", "page": 42, "chunk_id": "cchunk-pymupdf-v1-障诊断-150d65b3f4c3-000-150d65b3f4c3"}], "shadow_audit": {"request_id": "f17522407a1649a1ae1eed68867232d1", "question_id": null, "kb_id": "8fce4626859d44abb70a9ae5b0372cea", "generation": "g5162e7fb4208635103ff4ebb", "structural_valid": true, "invalid_chunk_count": 0, "invalid_page_count": 0, "invalid_document_count": 0, "duplicate_citation_count": 0, "emitted_citation_count": 3, "answer_without_citation": 0, "citation_traceability": 1, "cross_kb_reference": 0, "empty_citation_count": 0, "audit_status": "ok", "audit_mode": "shadow_non_blocking", "llm_called": false, "gold_used": false, "timestamp": "2026-08-02T20:58:29+0800"}, "safety_policy": "allowed", "error_code": null, "latency_seconds": 5.951, "fallback_detected": false, "stage": "smoke"}
